properties.statement:
Besides propagate_from's what-if delta (reasons_to_exist_lost), a read reports the current state across the whole design:
- every requirement whose reason_to_exist reads stands_on_acceptance_alone, or lost;
- every decision accepted without a holding chain;
- every stale check.
loop_status names the count.
MEASURED 2026-10-19 in the capstone: after U1 the 10–12 GHz requirement had already lost its reason, but reasons_to_exist_lost (a delta) did not list it; only get_node on that one requirement showed stands_on_acceptance_alone.
